.TH "Docv::Options" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Options \- Parsing options.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::Options\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Parsing options.
.PP
\fIunsafe\fR enables the requests that run commands or touch files (see
\fB\%Roff::Engine::UNSAFE\fR) and the \fB\%\eV\fR escape. \fIstdin\fR is where \fB\%.rd\fR reads
from; \fB\%nil\fR makes \fB\%.rd\fR read nothing. \fIhighlight\fR colors code examples
with tree\-sitter grammars (\fB\%Syntax\fR).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(unsafe : Bool = false, stdin : IO | Nil = nil, highlight : Bool = false)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef highlight : Bool\fR
.PP
\fBdef stdin : IO | Nil\fR
.PP
\fBdef unsafe : Bool\fR
